  "description": "The E-Horizon Tour Wave is a fully equipped e-trekking bike with a low step-over height and perfectly integrated components. It features LED lights for best visibility in urban environments. The internal gear hub drivetrain provides reliable shifting and is low maintenance. The hydraulic disc brakes offer superior braking power and modulation even in adverse weather conditions.\n\nThe Bosch Active Line Plus electric drive system offers efficient and nearly silent support, ideal for touring and commuting.\n\nThe Bosch PowerTube battery integrated into the frame can be removed for remote charging, while the battery cover remains on the bike to protect the empty battery bay from the elements. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: use the eBike Flow App to control your bike.",
